    val MAP: Map<String, String> = mapOf(
        "Our Lord, decide between us and our people with truth, for You are the best of those who decide." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamare aur hamari qaum ke darmiyan haq ke saath faisla farma, aur tu sabse behtar faisla karne wala hai.",
        "Our Lord, do not burden us with what we have no strength to bear. Pardon us, forgive us and have mercy on us. You are our Protector, so help us against the disbelieving people." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum par woh bojh na daal jiski hum mein taaqat nahi. Hamein maaf farma, hamein bakhsh de aur hum par reham farma. Tu hi hamara maula hai, to kafir qaum ke muqable mein hamari madad farma.",
        "Our Lord, do not let our hearts deviate after You have guided us, and grant us mercy from Yourself. Surely You are the Bestower." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamein hidayat dene ke baad hamare dilon ko tedha na kar, aur hamein apni taraf se rehmat ata farma. Beshak tu hi bahut dene wala hai.",
        "Our Lord, do not make us a trial for the wrongdoing people, and save us by Your mercy from the disbelieving people." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamein zalim qaum ke liye aazmaish na bana, aur apni rehmat se hamein kafir qaum se nijat de.",
        "Our Lord, do not make us a trial for those who disbelieve, and forgive us, our Lord. Surely You are the Almighty, the All-Wise." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamein kafiron ke liye aazmaish na bana, aur ae hamare Rab, hamein bakhsh de. Beshak tu hi zabardast, hikmat wala hai.",
