        "Our Lord, forgive us and our brothers who preceded us in faith, and do not place in our hearts any ill-will towards those who believe." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamein aur hamare un bhaiyon ko bakhsh de jo hum se pehle imaan laaye, aur hamare dilon mein imaan walon ki taraf se koi keena na rakh.",
