        "Our Lord, in You we put our trust, to You we turn, and to You is the final return." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum ne tujh hi par bharosa kiya, teri hi taraf rujoo kiya, aur teri hi taraf laut kar jaana hai.",
        "Our Lord, make us both submissive to You, and from our descendants a nation submissive to You. Show us our rites of worship and accept our repentance. Surely You are the Acceptor of repentance, the Most Merciful." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum dono ko apna farmanbardar bana, aur hamari aulad mein se ek ummat apni farmanbardar bana. Hamein hamari ibadat ke tareeqe dikha aur hamari tauba qubool farma. Beshak tu hi bahut tauba qubool karne wala, sabse zyada reham karne wala hai.",
        "Our Lord, perfect our light for us and forgive us. Surely You have power over all things." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamare liye hamara noor poora kar de aur hamein bakhsh de. Beshak tu har cheez par qaadir hai.",
        "Our Lord, pour patience upon us and let us die as Muslims." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum par sabr undel de aur hamein Musalman hone ki haalat mein maut de.",
