        "Our Lord, send down to us a table spread from heaven, to be a festival for the first of us and the last of us and a sign from You. Provide for us, for You are the best of providers." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum par aasmaan se ek dastarkhwan utaar jo hamare aglon aur pichhlon ke liye Eid ho aur teri taraf se ek nishani ho. Hamein rozi de, aur tu sabse behtar rozi dene wala hai.",
        "Our Lord, surely You are Most Kind, Most Merciful." to "Ae hamare Rab, beshak tu bahut mehrbaan, bahut reham farmane wala hai.",
        "Our Lord, turn away from us the punishment of Hell. Its punishment is truly unrelenting; it is indeed an evil abode and resting place." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum se Jahannam ka azaab pher de. Beshak uska azaab chimat jaane wala hai; beshak woh bahut bura thikana aur rehne ki jagah hai.",
