        "Our Lord, we fear that he may hasten to harm us or that he may transgress." to "Ae hamare Rab, hamein dar hai ke woh hum par zyadati karne mein jaldi kare ya sarkashi kare.",
        "Our Lord, we have believed, so forgive us and have mercy on us, for You are the best of the merciful." to "Ae hamare Rab, hum imaan laaye, to hamein bakhsh de aur hum par reham farma, aur tu sabse behtar reham farmane wala hai.",
